{"candidateAnswer":"A dented fender from a parking lot incident and a flat tire on the highway.","evidence":"[D11:1 | 6:13 pm on 10 April, 2023] John: Hey Maria, haven't talked for a few days. Had a wild week, my car broke down last Fri on my way to work. Trying to get it fixed but it's tough & putting a strain on my wallet. Staying positive & looking for a solution though.\n[D4:2 | 7:06 pm on 9 January, 2023] John: Hey Maria, I've been busy with work and family, but last week I had an unexpected incident on my way home. It reminded me how life can throw unexpected troubles our way.","itemId":"urn:uuid:9d0dc508-4b1d-59c7-9135-8d6f7e3a6e6a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:7607b148e01377ae9a0c78f10c3aeb1d773b767f48ed75e9edcd35b9f4145ed8","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What damages have happened to John's car?","referenceAnswer":"Broken windshield, Car broke down","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"7607b148e01377ae9a0c78f10c3aeb1d773b767f48ed75e9edcd35b9f4145ed8"}}]}